README
------

* DictionariesItems.java
  output the values of a dictionary

* DictionariesKeys.java
  output the keys of a dictionary

* DictionariesErrorHandling.java
  demonstrates how to look for keys of a dictionary with error handling

* HashmapClear.java
  empty (clear) the hashmap data set

* HashmapItems.java
  output the values of a hash map

* HashmapKeyCheck.java
  demonstrates how to check whether a key exists in a hash map

* HashmapKeys.java
  output the keys of a hash map

* HashmapOperations.java
  demonstrates how to add, update, and remove entries from a hashmap
  data set

* HashmapOutput.java
  demonstrates how to output the hashmap data set using forEach() method

* HashmapSize.java
  determine the number of entries in a hashmap data set

